{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320308001:1":{"text":"几位，你们是不是迷路了？需要我告诉你们离开这里的路吗？我收费很公道的哦。","source_cn":"几位，你们是不是迷路了？需要我告诉你们离开这里的路吗？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98D2DC332C10FCF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320308002:2":{"text":"哇，果然是商人会说的话！","source_cn":"哇，果然是商人会说的话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3DF875F6ACAEF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320308003:1":{"text":"诶？！你怎么会知道我是商人？","source_cn":"诶？！你怎么会知道我是商人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEFA9B55F1900D75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1320308003":{"text":"诶？！你怎么会知道我是商人？","source_cn":"诶？！你怎么会知道我是商人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEFA9B55F1900D75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320308004:1":{"text":"难不成……你就是那个隐居在这里、和我做生意的人？！","source_cn":"难不成……你就是那个隐居在这里、和我做生意的人？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x716277E0E2EB7091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1